; CHECK-NEXT:    [[INDEX_EVL_NEXT]] = add nuw i64 [[EVL_BASED_IV]], [[TMP5]]
; CHECK-NEXT:    [[VEC_IND_NEXT]] = add <vscale x 2 x i64> [[VEC_IND]], [[DOTSPLAT]]
